title: "KOA Agentic-RAG System: Evidence-Grounded Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Knee Osteoarthritis Clinical Guidelines"
message: "If you reference this research repository, architecture specification, or experimental protocol, please cite the metadata below. Note that KOA-GuidelineBench (rc0.2.0) is an independently governed benchmark release candidate and is attributed separately from the DV-OGEC-RAG method."
