abstract: >-
  Research documentation, source-aligned architecture specifications, and
  experimental design protocols for the KOA Agentic-RAG System, connecting the
  KOA-GuidelineBench (rc0.2.0) clinical guideline benchmark with the DV-OGEC-RAG
  (Dual-Verification Obligation-Guided Evidence-Controlled RAG) method. This
  repository presents the research framework, agentic execution lifecycle,
  controller state machine, benchmark-to-evaluator separation boundary, and
  prospective E1-v2 three-arm experimental protocol without redistributing
  licensed clinical guideline text, private runtime source code, or sealed
  evaluator references.
